export anchor FluentLikeStyle:
    number: 215
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Fluent-like
    idea: A modern desktop look built from soft layers, a tinted base, a lighter content layer with one rounded corner, and white 4px cards stacked like settings rows beside a navigation pane with a small accent pill.
    base: light
    palette:
        base: #eef0f3, the window base under the title bar and navigation pane
        layer: #f9f9fa, the content layer and the style sheet
        card: #ffffff, project rows, KPI tiles and panels
        stroke: #e3e5e8, the layer edge, dividers and field sides
        text: #1a1a1a, primary text and the focus ring
        textSecondary: #5c5f64, captions, meta and chart labels
        accent: #0a5cb0, the accent button, nav pill, field underline, progress and this week bars
        accentTint: #e6f0fa, the project icon tiles
        caution: #fff4ce, the overdue info bar, with its icon in #8a5300
        onTrack: #0f7b2e, a filled circle with a white tick
        atRisk: #9a5a00, a filled triangle with a white bang
        behind: #c0261b, a filled octagon with a white cross and the overdue value
    type:
        Text uses Segoe UI Variable Text, Segoe UI, system-ui,
        -apple-system, Roboto, Noto Sans, Helvetica Neue, Arial,
        sans-serif, and titles use the Display cut of the same family. A
        ramp of Title 28 on 36 semibold for the greeting, Subtitle 20 on
        28 semibold for section heads, KPI values 28 semibold, body strong
        14 on 20 for project names, body 14 on 20 and caption 12 on 16.
    layout:
        No top header band. A 48px title bar sits on the base with a back
        button, a small gradient app mark and the name Brightwork on the
        left, a 480px search box in the centre and the accent New project
        button, a bell with a red dot and a round persona on the right.
        Under it a 264px navigation pane on the base holds a hamburger
        button and five 36px items with icons, the current one with a
        light grey fill, bold text and a 3 by 16px accent pill at its left
        edge, and Settings pinned at the bottom under a divider. The
        content layer fills the rest, lighter, with a hairline edge and an
        8px top left corner. Inside it a small date caption sits over the
        greeting title, then a full width yellow info bar says Caution,
        4 tasks are overdue, with an Open Tasks button at its end. Below,
        two columns. The wide left column has a Projects subtitle with a
        See all projects link and six white cards stacked 4px apart, each
        a row of a 40px tinted icon tile, name over team and due date, a
        progress block with tasks and percent over a 3px bar, the status
        and a chevron. The 320px right column has a This week subtitle
        over a two by two grid of KPI tiles, then a chart panel and a
        recent activity panel with round personas and times under each
        line. Under 1100px the columns merge with the KPI tiles first in
        a row of four. Under 760px the pane becomes a Home disclosure
        button that opens a menu of all six items, the search drops to its
        own row and project cards stack their progress and status.
    spacing: A 4px base. Cards sit 4px apart, sections 24px apart, and the layer has 28 by 40px padding.
    density: Comfortable. 36px nav items, 32px controls and 68px project rows.
    corners: 4px on controls, cards and tiles, 8px on the content layer and flyouts, round personas.
    borders: Hairline strokes, with a darker bottom edge on fields and buttons in the manner of a soft bevel.
    shadows: Cards lift with a 1px ring at 5 percent plus 0 2px 4px at 5 percent. Flyouts use 0 8px 16px at 12 percent.
    icons:
        16px thin line icons at stroke 1.5 for navigation and labels.
        Status icons are filled shapes with a white mark, a circle with a
        tick, a triangle with a bang and an octagon with a cross, beside
        the word in plain text.
    focus: A 2px near black outline offset 1px with a 4px white halo outside it. A focused field instead gets a 2px accent bottom border.
    tone: Calm and plain, such as Caution, See all projects, Open Tasks and Recent activity.
